 *
 * Every factual claim here is checked against the code rather than the marketing copy:
 *   - what the extension captures    web/extension/src/capture/pipeline.ts
 *   - what it stores                 web/extension/src/shared/storage.ts
 *   - where it may talk              web/extension/manifest.json (host_permissions)
 *   - what reaches Anthropic         crates/curio-server/src/worker/assess.rs
 *   - where the key lives            crates/curio-server/src/secrets.rs
